{
  "info": {
    "name": "Profile",
    "description": "API endpoints for user profile. Unified route `GET|PATCH /api/v1/profile` returns/updates profile based on JWT role.\n\n## Changelog (2026-09-02) – Profile Enhancements\n- **Schema:** `coach_profiles` + `client_profiles` now have `phone_number (VARCHAR, nullable, max 20)` and `location (VARCHAR, nullable, max 100)` – `prisma/schema.prisma:68,92`.\n- **Validation `src/modules/profile/profile.validation.ts`:**\n  - `UpdateCoachProfileInput` + `UpdateClientProfileInput` now accept `username, phone_number, location`.\n  - `username`: string 1-100 chars, checked for uniqueness (409 `username_already_taken`).\n  - `phone_number`: string max 20 (trimmed, empty string → null).\n  - `location`: string max 100 (trimmed, empty string → null).\n  - `specialization`: now ENUM-validated via `isValidSpecialization()` – must be one of 16 keys (see Specializations folder). Old 100-char free text removed. Error `specialization_invalid` now means \"must be one of allowed values\".\n- **Service `src/modules/profile/profile.service.ts`:**\n  - `getCoachProfile` returns `specialization_display: {en, ar}|null` + `phone_number` + `location`.\n  - `getClientProfile` returns `phone_number` + `location`.\n  - `updateCoachProfile` / `updateClientProfile` accept `username` (updates `users` table) + `phone_number`/`location` (nullify on empty). Gender is normalized via `GENDER_MAP` and synced bidirectionally to `client_answers` (gender question) – updating gender patches the related answer index.\n  - All updates return new fields; `specialization_display` added for coach.\n- **Auth `src/modules/auth/auth.validation.ts`:** `POST /api/v1/auth/signup` when `role=coach` validates optional `specialization` against same ENUM.\n- **i18n `src/locales/en.json|ar.json`:** new keys `phone_number_invalid`, `location_invalid` + updated `specialization_invalid`.\n\n**Auth:** All endpoints require `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`. Use `coach_token` or `client_token`.\n**Base URL:** `{{base_url}}` default `http://localhost:3000/api/v1`.\n\n**Postman AI hints:**\n- PATCH body is partial – send only fields you want to update; at least one of `username, bio, specialization, phone_number, location` (coach) or `username, gender, birth_date, height, weight, goal, phone_number, location` (client) required else 400 `no_fields_to_update`.\n- To clear phone/location send `\"phone_number\": \"\"` or `\"location\": \"\"`.\n- Specialization must be a KEY, not display string (e.g. `\"strength_training\"` not \"Strength Training\").\n- Gender accepts `male|female|Male|Female|ذكر|أنثى|other|unspecified` – normalized to `male|female` for DB and synced to answers.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "coach_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "client_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Get Profile",
      "description": "GET /profile – returns role-based profile. Coach includes `specialization_display` + `phone_number`/`location`. Client includes `phone_number`/`location` + gender/goal etc.\nRequires Bearer token. Role from JWT decides which profile is returned.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Coach Profile",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200); });",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Has specialization_display and phone_number', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(json).to.have.property('profile');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.profile).to.have.property('specialization_display');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.profile).to.have.property('phone_number');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.profile).to.have.property('location');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{coach_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "en",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/profile",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["profile"]
            },
            "description": "Returns `{ user: {id, username, email, role, ...}, profile: {id, bio, specialization, specialization_display:{en, ar}|null, phone_number, location, profile_image} }`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Coach Profile Example",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Authorization",
                    "value": "Bearer {{coach_token}}"
                  }
                ],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/profile",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["profile"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [],
              "cookie": [],
